## 🏗️ Build Production (Android APK)

```bash
cd d:\Railan\apl\CipherMeet\cipher-meet-mobile\android

# Debug APK
./gradlew assembleDebug
# APK di: android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk

# Release APK (perlu keystore)
./gradlew assembleRelease
```

