## 📁 Struktur Proyek

```
CipherMeet/
├── cipher-meet-backend/         # NestJS API
│   ├── src/modules/
│   │   ├── auth/                # JWT, Argon2id, OTP
│   │   ├── users/               # Profile CRUD, geoloc
│   │   ├── discovery/           # Swipe feed, match
│   │   ├── chat/                # E2EE WebSocket + MongoDB
│   │   ├── keys/                # X3DH Signal Protocol
│   │   ├── security/            # 2FA TOTP, sessions
│   │   ├── premium/             # Subscription tiers
│   │   ├── notifications/       # FCM + BullMQ
│   │   └── media/               # S3/R2 upload
│   └── docker-compose.yml       # Postgres + MongoDB + Redis
│
├── cipher-meet-mobile/          # React Native (bare)
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── theme/               # Colors, typography, spacing
│   │   ├── components/          # atoms/ molecules/ organisms/
│   │   ├── screens/             # auth/ discovery/ chat/ profile/ wizard/ premium/
│   │   ├── navigation/          # RootNavigator
│   │   ├── stores/              # authStore, discoveryStore, socketStore, e2eeStore
│   │   ├── hooks/               # useDiscovery, useChat, useUsers
│   │   ├── services/api/        # apiClient + auth/discovery/chat/users.api
│   │   └── types/               # user.ts
│   └── App.tsx
│
└── .github/workflows/ci.yml     # GitHub Actions CI
```
